  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Taking The Farm**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Touch of Grey**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Black Water Falls**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **A Needle in Your Eye No 16**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **WarOnDrugs2011-12-11.nyctaper** (recommended): audience recording; 13 songs; 84 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **WarOnDrugs2011-12-11.nyctaper**: taped by nyctaper; transferred by nyctaper; source: AUD [1]. Also: Recorded using Neumann KM-150s and DPA 4021 mics into an Edirol R-44 recorder; Processed in Soundforge for levels, EQ, and mixdown, then tracked with CDWave; Final output is a FLAC file derived from 24-bit 48kHz WAV sources [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Photo by Marc Whitman (All rights reserved): [The War on Drugs @ Bowery Ballroom, 12/11/11](https://www.flickr.com/photos/51115320@N00/6502216875/) [3]\n- Photo by Marc Whitman (All rights reserved): [The War on Drugs @ Bowery Ballroom, 12/11/11](https://www.flickr.com/photos/51115320@N00/6502190829/) [4]\n- Photo by uncredited: [the page](https://www.flickr.com/photos/51115320@N00/6502216875/) [5]\n- Photo by uncredited: [the page](https://www.flickr.com/photos/51115320@N00/6502190829/) [6]",
